ts factors| 4b\n    4e --\u003e|reads mailbox| 4b\n    \n    5a --\u003e|initializes| 5b\n    5b --\u003e|queries| 5c\n    5c --\u003e|updates| 5d\n    \n    style Storage fill:#a5d8ff\n    style TaskMgmt fill:#fcc2d7\n    style GraphOps fill:#99e9f2\n    style Analysis fill:#d0bfff\n    style Recommendation fill:#ffec99"
